      "source_line_end": 152,
      "current_tex": "\\begin{definition}[Reciprocal Image]\n\\label{def:reciprocal-image}\nLet $A\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}$ and suppose $0\\notin A$.  The \\emph{reciprocal\nimage} of $A$ is the set\n\\[\n  A^{-1}:=\\left\\{\\frac{1}{a}:a\\in A\\right\\}.\n\\]\n\\end{definition}",
